    "Lifegain"
  ],
  "strategy": "Felothar the Steadfast turns a wall of defenders into an army: every creature you control deals combat damage equal to its toughness and may attack as though it had no defender, so Wall of Omens, Wall of Blossoms, Overgrown Battlement and Axebane Guardian draw, ramp and then swing. Assault Formation, Baldin, Century Herdmaster and Walking Bulwark do the same job a second time, Tower Defense and Canopy Gargantuan raise the toughness that now matters, and Towering Titan arrives with a +1/+1 counter for every point of toughness already on the board. Arbor Adherent, Axebane Guardian, Overgrown Battlement and Wall of Roots ramp off the same bodies, Rampart Architect and Hornet Nest keep making more of them, and Wall of Reverence, Rhox Faithmender and Indulging Patrician turn the toughness into life and drain. Swords to Plowshares, Infernal Grasp, Anguished Unmaking and Despark answer threats, Expel the Interlopers and Slaughter the Strong sweep the board while the low-power walls survive, and Reunion of the House brings the cheap ones back.",
